---
---

<section class="home-hero onload-animation">
	<div class="hero-copy">
		<p class="eyebrow">DBA FIELD NOTES · 2026</p>
		<h1>把生产事故，<br /><span>写成下一次的解法。</span></h1>
		<p class="intro">
			这里没有万能提示词，只有 OceanBase、Oracle 与 MySQL
			的真实排障记录、可复用命令和一套 654 题的 OBCP 练习。
		</p>
		<div class="hero-actions">
			<a class="action primary" href="/quiz-library/">开始刷题 <span>→</span></a>
			<a class="action secondary" href="/archive/">翻阅实战笔记</a>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="status-card" aria-label="站点内容概览">
		<div class="status-head">
			<span class="status-dot"></span>
			<span>LEARNING CONSOLE</span>
			<small>ONLINE</small>
		</div>
		<div class="status-main">
			<strong>654</strong>
			<span>道 OBCP 练习题<br />单选 · 多选 · 判断</span>
		</div>
		<div class="status-rows">
			<a href="/quiz-library/"><span>今日建议</span><b>先做 20 题</b><i>↗</i></a>
			<a href="/archive/"><span>技术方向</span><b>数据库运维</b><i>↗</i></a>
			<a href="/talks/"><span>最近更新</span><b>DBA 日常</b><i>↗</i></a>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<div class="section-label onload-animation">
	<span>最近笔记</span>
	<a href="/archive/">查看全部 →</a>
</div>

<style>
	.home-hero,
	.section-label {
		--hero-text: #25211e;
		--hero-muted: #746d65;
		--hero-subtle: #948b82;
		--hero-line: rgba(37, 33, 30, 0.12);
		color: var(--hero-text);
	}
	:global(.dark) .home-hero,
	:global(.dark) .section-label {
		--hero-text: #f5eee8;
		--hero-muted: #c8bdb4;
		--hero-subtle: #9f958d;
		--hero-line: rgba(255, 244, 235, 0.14);
	}
	.home-hero {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.45fr) minmax(18rem, 0.55fr);
		gap: clamp(0.75rem, 1.4vw, 1.25rem);
		margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
	}
	.hero-copy,
	.status-card {
		border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary) 18%, transparent);
		border-radius: 1.35rem;
		background: var(--card-bg);
	}
	.hero-copy {
		padding: clamp(1.6rem, 5vw, 3.4rem);
		position: relative;
		overflow: hidden;
	}
	.hero-copy::after {
		content: "";
		position: absolute;
		right: -4rem;
		bottom: -5rem;
		width: 15rem;
		height: 15rem;
		border: 1.5rem solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary) 8%, transparent);
		border-radius: 50%;
		pointer-events: none;
	}
	.eyebrow {
		margin: 0 0 1.3rem;
		color: var(--primary);
		font-size: 0.72rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		letter-spacing: 0.14em;
	}
	h1 {
		margin: 0;
		max-width: 12ch;
		font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 6vw, 4.3rem);
		line-height: 1.03;
		letter-spacing: -0.055em;
		color: var(--hero-text);
	}
	h1 span { color: var(--primary); }
	.intro {
		max-width: 52rem;
		margin: 1.4rem 0 1.8rem;
		font-size: 1rem;
		line-height: 1.8;
		color: var(--hero-muted);
	}
	.hero-actions {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		position: relative;
		z-index: 1;
	}
	.action {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		min-height: 3rem;
		padding: 0 1.2rem;
		border-radius: 0.7rem;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		font-weight: 750;
	}
	.action.primary { background: var(--primary); color: var(--deep-text); font-weight: 800; }
	.action.primary:hover { filter: brightness(0.92); }
	.action.primary span { margin-left: 1.8rem; }
	.action.secondary { border: 1px solid var(--hero-line); color: var(--hero-text); }
	.status-card { padding: 1.1rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
	.status-head {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		font: 700 0.65rem/1 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, monospace;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
		color: var(--hero-subtle);
	}
	.status-head small { margin-left: auto; color: #2a9d62; }
	.status-dot {
		width: 0.5rem;
		height: 0.5rem;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: #2a9d62;
		box-shadow: 0 0 0 0.22rem color-mix(in srgb, #2a9d62 15%, transparent);
	}
	.status-main {
		padding: 2rem 0.7rem 1.6rem;
		display: flex;
		align-items: flex-end;
		gap: 1rem;
	}
	.status-main strong {
		font-size: 3.5rem;
		line-height: 0.85;
		letter-spacing: -0.08em;
		color: var(--primary);
	}
	.status-main span { font-size: 0.77rem; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--hero-muted); }
	.status-rows { margin-top: auto; border-top: 1px solid var(--hero-line); }
	.status-rows a {
		width: 100%;
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1rem;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		padding: 0.9rem 0.2rem;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hero-line);
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		color: var(--hero-subtle);
	}
	.status-rows b { color: var(--hero-text); font-weight: 650; }
	.status-rows i { font-style: normal; color: var(--primary); }
	.section-label {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		padding: 0.45rem 0.2rem 0.75rem;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		letter-spacing: 0.06em;
	}
	.section-label a { color: var(--primary); font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: 0; }
	@media (max-width: 980px) {
		.home-hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
		.status-main { padding: 1.5rem 0.4rem; }
		.status-rows { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
		.status-rows a { grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; }
		.status-rows i { display: none; }
	}
	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.hero-copy { padding: clamp(1.35rem, 6vw, 1.7rem); }
		h1 { font-size: clamp(2.15rem, 11vw, 2.8rem); }
		.intro { font-size: 0.92rem; }
		.action { flex: 1; min-width: 9rem; }
		.section-label { padding-left: 0.65rem; padding-right: 0.65rem; }
		.status-rows { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
		.status-rows a { grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1rem; }
		.status-rows i { display: block; }
	}
</style>
